+```powershell
+dotnet tests/bin/Release/net10.0-windows/DiskAtlas.Tests.dll --ntfs-bitmap-prefix-tests
+dotnet tests/bin/Release/net10.0-windows/DiskAtlas.Tests.dll --ntfs-fixture-index-tests
